Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: Restore Miku private policy files

Restore recovery, file contexts, compatibility mappings and the
mediashell certificate used by MikuUI.

Change-Id: I151b4f48afdf4a6030c6e283eaf762170af0a308
